{"type":"uit-contribution","plugin":"Culprit","kinds":["free"],"entries":[{"Original":"Running in reduced mode. Unavailable: ","Translated":"以简化模式运行。不可用：","Context":"[Culprit] Notifier.ShowReducedMode","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ Notification.set_Content"},{"Original":". See the Live tab.","Translated":"查看 “实时” 选项卡。","Context":"[Culprit] Notifier.ShowReducedMode","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ Notification.set_Content"},{"Original":"Open Culprit. \"/culprit pause\" and \"/culprit resume\" toggle detection, \"/culprit reset\" clears counters, \"/culprit report\" saves a text report you can share.","Translated":"打开 culprit。“/culprit 暂停” 和 “/culprit 恢复” 的切换检测，“/culprit 重置” 会清除计数器，“/culprit 报告” 会保存一个可以分享的文本报告。","Context":"[Culprit] Plugin..ctor","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ CommandInfo.HelpMessage"},{"Original":"[Culprit] Report saved to ","Translated":"[culprit] 报告保存到","Context":"[Culprit] Plugin.SaveReport","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ IChatGui.Print"},{"Original":"[Culprit] Could not save the report: ","Translated":"[Culprit] 无法保存报告：","Context":"[Culprit] Plugin.SaveReport","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ IChatGui.PrintError"},{"Original":"Stall","Translated":"故障","Context":"[Culprit] ReportBuilder.RuleName","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextUnformatted"},{"Original":"Sustained","Translated":"持续","Context":"[Culprit] ReportBuilder.RuleName","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextUnformatted"},{"Original":"Errors","Translated":"错误","Context":"[Culprit] ReportBuilder.RuleName","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TableSetupColumn"},{"Original":"Unattributed","Translated":"未归因","Context":"[Culprit] ReportBuilder.RuleName","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextUnformatted"},{"Original":"no plugin","Translated":"无插件