ublic-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.SliderFloat"},{"Original":"Errors before warning","Translated":"警告前的错误","Context":"[Culprit] SettingsTab.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.SliderInt"},{"Original":"Error window (s)","Translated":"错误窗口 (s)","Context":"[Culprit] SettingsTab.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.SliderFloat"},{"Original":"Unattributed frame (ms)","Translated":"未分配帧 (毫秒)","Context":"[Culprit] SettingsTab.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.SliderFloat"},{"Original":"Alerts","Translated":"警告","Context":"[Culprit] SettingsTab.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextUnformatted"},{"Original":"Cooldown per plugin and rule (min)","Translated":"每个插件和规则的冷却时间 (min)","Context":"[Culprit] SettingsTab.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.SliderFloat"},{"Original":"Warn on the first incident","Translated":"第一次事件警告","Context":"[Culprit] SettingsTab.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Checkbox"},{"Original":"Off: a plugin must stall or drain twice within the repeat window before you get a toast, so one-off costs like opening a window stay quiet. Every incident is still recorded on the Incidents tab.","Translated":"关闭：插件必须在重复窗口内停滞或耗尽两次，才能获得吐司，所以像打开窗口这样的一次性开销请保持安静。每个事件仍然记录在 “事件” 选项卡中。","Context":"[Culprit] SettingsTab.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.SetTooltip"},{"Original":"Repeat window (min)","Translated":"重复窗口 (min)","Context":"[Culprit] SettingsTab.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.SliderFloat"},{"Original":"Toast unattributed stalls","Translated":"吐司未分配的停机时间","Context":"[Culprit] SettingsTab.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Checkbox"},{"Original":"Frames over the unattributed limit where no plugin crossed the stall limit. The game itself causes most of these, so they are logged but not shown by default.","Translated":"超过未分配限制的帧，其中没有插件超过失速限制。游戏本身造成了大部分这些情况，所以它们会被记录下来，但默认情况下不会显示。","Context":"[Culprit] SettingsTab.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.SetTooltip"},{"Original":"Mute all toasts","Translated":"静音所有 Toast","Context":"[Culprit] SettingsTab.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Checkbox"},{"Original":"Detection and the incident log keep running.","Translated":"检测和事件日志继续运行。","Context":"[Culprit] SettingsTab.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.SetTooltip"},{"Original":"Write incidents to /xllog (debug level)","Translated":"将事件写入/xllog(调试级别)","Context":"[Culprit] SettingsTab.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Checkbox"},{"Original":"Ignored plugins","Translated":"被忽略的插件","Context":"[Culprit] SettingsTab.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextUnformatted"},{"Original":"None. Tick Ignore on the Live tab to add one.","Translated":"无。点击 “直播” 标签上的 “忽略” 来添加一个。","Context":"[Culprit] SettingsTab.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextDisabled"},{"Original":"Support","Translated":"支持","Context":"[Culprit] SettingsTab.DrawKofiButton","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGuiComponents.IconButtonWithText"},{"Original":"Draw stats","Translated":"绘制统计数据","Context":"[Culprit] DrawStatsProbe..ctor","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextColored"},{"Original":"Frame time","Translated":"帧时间","Context":"[Culprit] FrameProbe..ctor","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextColored"},{"Original":"Log stream","Translated":"日志流","Context":"[Culprit] LogProbe..ctor","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextColored"},{"Original":"Update stats","Translated":"更新统计数据","Context":"[Culprit] UpdateStatsProbe..ctor","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextColored"}],"resources":[],"attributes":[]}